Z||000000||Robert||11-01-2001||03:18 PM||||Is anyone else out there having trouble upgrading to XP?<BR>At home I can’t seem to get past the first restart in the upgrade procedure.  I end up with error messages saying for me to run CHKDSK to find any errors.  I have done this, and still can’t get passed that screen.<BR>At the shop we tried it on one computer on our internal network.  We got through the install fine, but can’t print to any of the network printers.<P>Anyone have any ideas?<P>Robert<BR>||||reg||9
